/source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></span><span data-path-to-node="164,0,4" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">。復健專科醫師應如何依據病患之小腿三頭肌痙攣等級、膝關節反曲（Genu recurvatum）程度與本體感覺缺失狀況，擬定最精準的裝具生物力學校正處方？</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c2963483191="" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">   <!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2963483191="" _nghost-ng-c3394121343="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></blockquote><font face="Google Sans Text, sans-serif"><br><br><br><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><p data-path-to-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">在中風偏癱步態重建中，裝具的處方本質是<b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="19" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">矢狀面與冠狀面之力學力矩管理（Moment management）</b>，特別是透過控制踝關節以調節踝-足裝具／鞋底力矩臂（AFO-Footwear Combination, AFO-FC）對近端膝關節（底屈-膝伸展力矩偶，Plantarflexion-Knee Extension Couple）的連帶影響。</p><p data-path-to-node="1" id="p-rc_0620dffc4673ab33-1007" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;"><span data-path-to-node="1,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">指引指出 FES 與 AFO 在改善步態速度、平衡與功能性活動上療效相當（COR 1, LOE A）</span><span data-path-to-node="1,1" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1273491722="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1273491722="" class="superscript" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important;"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></span><span data-path-to-node="1,2" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">，但兩者適用的生物力學亞群截然不同。針對<b data-path-to-node="1,2" data-index-in-node="20" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">小腿三頭肌痙攣等級</b>、<b data-path-to-node="1,2" data-index-in-node="30" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">膝反曲（Genu recurvatum）程度</b>與<b data-path-to-node="1,2" data-index-in-node="53" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">本體感覺缺失</b>三大維度，臨床決策與力學調校邏輯如下：</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c2963483191="" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">   <!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2963483191="" _nghost-ng-c3394121343="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><h3 data-path-to-node="3" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">一、 依核心臨床特徵的決策矩陣</h3><table data-path-to-node="4" style="margin-bottom: 32px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><thead style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><tr style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><strong style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin: 0px !important;">評估維度</strong></td><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><strong style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin: 0px !important;">嚴重度 / 臨床表現</strong></td><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><strong style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin: 0px !important;">優先考量裝具</strong></td><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><strong style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin: 0px !important;">生物力學校正機制與調整要點</strong></td><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><strong style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin: 0px !important;">不建議 / 禁忌選項</strong></td></tr></thead><tbody style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><tr style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><span data-path-to-node="4,1,0,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="4,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">小腿三頭肌痙攣 (MAS)</b></span></td><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="4,1,1,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;"><b data-path-to-node="4,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">MAS <span class="math-inline" data-math="\ge" data-index-in-node="4" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">&gt;=</span> 2～3</b></p><br data-path-to-node="4,1,1,1" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="4,1,1,2" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">（動態或靜態底屈張力高、伴隨陣攣）</p></td><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="4,1,2,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;"><b data-path-to-node="4,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">硬式塑料 AFO (Solid AFO)</b></p><br data-path-to-node="4,1,2,1" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="4,1,2,2" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;"><i data-path-to-node="4,1,2,2" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">(或剛性碳纖維 AFO)</i></p></td><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="4,1,3,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">• 鎖定踝關節，阻斷負重初期比目魚肌因被動拉扯誘發之牽張反射（Stretch reflex）。</p><br data-path-to-node="4,1,3,1" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="4,1,3,2" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">• 足跟部需搭配吸震緩衝材料（SACH-like heel）或推進弧（Rocker sole），代償失去的第一足跟搖椅（Heel rocker）。</p></td><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="4,1,4,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">• <b data-path-to-node="4,1,4,0" data-index-in-node="2" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">活動式 AFO (Articulated)</b>：易在負重期觸發痙攣。</p><br data-path-to-node="4,1,4,1" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="4,1,4,2" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">• <b data-path-to-node="4,1,4,2" data-index-in-node="2" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">FES</b>：腓神經刺激無法抗衡強烈痙攣阻力。</p></td></tr><tr style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"></td><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="4,2,1,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;"><b data-path-to-node="4,2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">MAS &lt;= 1+</b></p><br data-path-to-node="4,2,1,1" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="4,2,1,2" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">（輕度痙攣或純粹弛緩性垂足）</p></td><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><span data-path-to-node="4,2,2,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="4,2,2,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">油壓活動式 AFO</b> 或 <b data-path-to-node="4,2,2,0" data-index-in-node="12" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">FES</b></span></td><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="4,2,3,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">• 活動式 AFO 可設定背屈阻尼（Dorsiflexion assist）與底屈限位，保留自然脛骨前傾（Tibia progression）。</p><br data-path-to-node="4,2,3,1" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="4,2,3,2" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">• FES 可透過擺動期主動刺激脛前肌達成生理性清地。</p></td><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><span data-path-to-node="4,2,4,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">• 過度僵硬