>底屈擋塊（Plantarflexion stop at <span class="math-inline" data-math="0^\circ" data-index-in-node="35" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">0'</span>）</b>，嚴格限制足底屈曲角度，防止脛骨過早被向後牽拉所導致的被動膝鎖死。</span></td><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><span data-path-to-node="4,4,4,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">• 無背/底屈限制的軟式護踝。</span></td></tr><tr style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><span data-path-to-node="4,5,0,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="4,5,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">本體感覺缺失 (Proprioception)</b></span></td><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="4,5,1,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;"><b data-path-to-node="4,5,1,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">嚴重缺失</b></p><br data-path-to-node="4,5,1,1" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="4,5,1,2" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">（關節位置覺與運動覺喪失，需全無視覺代償）</p></td><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><span data-path-to-node="4,5,2,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="4,5,2,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">熱塑型 Solid AFO</b></span></td><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><span data-path-to-node="4,5,3,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">• 全包覆性硬殼提供大面積皮膚接觸與骨突支撐，將地面反作用力直接轉移至脛骨粗隆與腓骨頭下方，提供被動機械剛性結構，避免足踝內外翻塌陷。</span></td><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="4,5,4,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">• <b data-path-to-node="4,5,4,0" data-index-in-node="2" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">單純表面 FES</b>：患者缺乏感覺感知肢體空間方位，跌倒風險增高。</p><br data-path-to-node="4,5,4,1" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="4,5,4,2" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">• 支撐面積小的極簡型碳纖維支架。</p></td></tr><tr style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"></td><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="4,6,1,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;"><b data-path-to-node="4,6,1,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">輕度受損至完整</b></p><br data-path-to-node="4,6,1,1" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="4,6,1,2" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">（能感知足著地與地面變化）</p></td><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><span data-path-to-node="4,6,2,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="4,6,2,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">碳纖維儲能型 AFO</b> 或 <b data-path-to-node="4,6,2,0" data-index-in-node="13" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">FES</b></span></td><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="4,6,3,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">• 碳纖維於立腳末期儲存形變位能並釋放，提升推進效率（Push-off）。</p><br data-path-to-node="4,6,3,1" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="4,6,3,2" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">• FES 透過神經肌肉電刺激提供外加的感覺輸入（Sensory cueing），加速大腦感覺運動皮質再學習。</p></td><td style="border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><span data-path-to-node="4,6,4,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">• 沉重且固定死角度的傳統厚塑料 AFO。</span></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 data-path-to-node="6" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">二、 四大裝具生物力學特性之深度解析</h3><h4 data-path-to-node="7" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">1. 傳統硬式塑料 AFO (Solid AFO)</h4><ul data-path-to-node="8" style="padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><li style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="8,0,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;"><b data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">力學本質：</b> 剛性最高、三個維度（矢狀、額狀、水平面）控制力最強。</p></li><li style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="8,1,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;"><b data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">臨床最適適應症：</b> <b data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="9" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">重度小腿痙攣（MAS &gt;&nbsp;2）+ 顯著膝反曲 + 踝關節內翻不穩 + 本體感覺喪失</b>。</p></li><li style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="8,2,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;"><b data-path-to-node="8,2,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">醫師調校心法：</b> 務必進行「<b data-path-to-node="8,2,0" data-index-in-node="13" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">傾斜角度調整（Tuning the AFO-FC）</b>」。單純將腳踝擺在 <span class="math-inline" data-math="90^\circ" data-index-in-node="48" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">90'</span>&nbsp;往往不足以抑制膝反曲；若穿鞋後仍有反曲，應在<b>足跟墊高（Heel lift）</b>以強迫脛骨前傾，創造外加之膝屈曲力矩（Knee flexion moment）</p></li></ul></blockquote></font><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><font face="Google Sans Text, sans-serif"><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">在「有穿著特定剛性 AFO（如 Solid AFO）」時：足跟墊高「可以」抑制膝反曲。</b></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">在「裸足或穿一般普通鞋（未穿 AFO）」時：足跟墊高「反而會加劇」膝反曲。</b></p></li></blockquote></font></blockquote></blockquote><font face="Google Sans Text, sans-serif"><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><h4 data-path-to-node="9" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">2. 油壓關節活動式 AFO (Articulated / Tamarack AFO)</h4><ul data-path-to-node="10" style="padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><li style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="10,0,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;"><b data-path-to-node="10,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">力學本質：</b> 矢狀面自由度解鎖，保留背屈活動（允許第二搖椅發生），但具備堅硬的底屈擋塊（Plantarflexion Stop）或油壓阻尼。</p></li><li style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="10,1,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;"><b data-path-to-node="10,1,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">臨床最適適應症：</b> <b data-path-to-node="10,1,0" data-index-in-node="9" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">輕度張力（MAS <span class="math-inline" data-math="\le" data-index-in-node="18" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">&lt;=</span> 1）+ 具備基本立位平衡 + 輕度動態膝反曲</b>。</p></li><li style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="10,2,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;"><b data-path-to-node="10,2,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">優勢與限制：</b> 上下樓梯、斜坡行走以及坐站轉移極具功能性；但若病患小腿三頭肌陣攣（Clonus）強烈，活動鉸鏈在每次足觸地時的微動可能反覆引發肌梭激發，進而誘發張力暴衝。</p></li></ul><h4 data-path-to-node="11" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">3. 碳纖維儲能型 AFO (Carbon Fiber Dynamic Response AFO)</h4><ul data-path-to-node="12" style="padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><li style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="12,0,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;"><b data-path-to-node="12,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">力學本質：</b> 輕量化、利用材料力學於立腳中期吸收衝擊儲能，並於立腳末期（Preswing）彈性釋放推進力。</p></li><li style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="12,1,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;"><b data-path-to-node="12,1,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">臨床最適適應症：</b> <b data-path-to-node="12,1,0" data-index-in-node="9" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">步行速度較快（<span class="math-inline" data-math="&gt;0.6\sim0.8\text{ m/s}" data-index-in-node="16" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">&gt;0.6 ~ 0.8 m/s</span>）、無嚴重痙攣、無嚴重膝反曲、本體感覺尚可之高功能社區型復健患者</b>。</p></li><li style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="12,2,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;"><b data-path-to-node="12,2,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">臨床盲點：</b> 碳纖維支架多數為預製量產（Off-the-shelf），額狀面（內外翻）控制力普遍弱於客製塑料，且其前傾彈力若過強，容易讓具有反曲傾向的膝關節在 Terminal stance 期因後推力而彈入過度伸展。</p></li></ul><h4 data-path-to-node="13" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">4. 穿戴式功能性電刺激 (FES, 如 WalkAide / Bioness)</h4><ul data-path-to-node="14" style="padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><li style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="14,0,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;"><b data-path-to-node="14,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">力學本質：</b> 「動態生理性矯治」而非「機械結構支撐」。透過傾斜感測器或足底壓力開關觸發，在擺動期（Swing phase）精確刺激腓總神經（Deep fibular nerve），引發脛前肌主動收縮以完成足背屈與外翻。</p></li><li style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="14,1,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;"><b data-path-to-node="14,1,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">臨床最適適應症：</b> <b data-path-to-node="14,1,0" data-index-in-node="9" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">中樞性單純垂足（Drop foot）、痙攣度低（MAS <span class="math-inline" data-math="\le" data-index-in-node="37" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">&lt;=</span>&nbsp;1+）、無嚴重骨骼畸形、無顯著立腳期膝過伸</b>。</p></li><li style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="14,2,0" id="p-rc_0620dffc4673ab33-1008" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;"><span data-path-to-node="14,2,0,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="14,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">優劣抉擇：</b> 優點在於不限制踝關節自主活動、避免小腿肌廢用性萎縮，並具備神經可塑性誘發潛能（COR 2b, LOE A）</span><span data-path-to-node="14,2,0,1" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: