178" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">第三十段：吞嚥障礙篩檢、處置與營養支持（Dysphagia Screening, Management, and Nutritional Support）</h3><h4 data-path-to-node="179" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;">【繁體中文專業翻譯】</h4><ul data-path-to-node="180" style="padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><li style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="180,0,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;"><b data-path-to-node="180,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">早期常規篩檢（COR 1）：</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="180,0,1" style="padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><li style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><p data-path-to-node="180,0,1,0,0" id="p-rc_5fa157fb5acc641f-490" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;"><span data-path-to-node="180,0,1,0,0,0" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">急性期患者<b data-path-to-node="180,0,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="5" style="font-family: &quot;Google S